SUMMARY:The Friendship Band Friendsgiving Fundraiser
LOCATION:Iron Horse\, 18 Center St\, Northampton\, MA 01060
DESCRIPTION:with Mind Left Body\nA twelve-member rock and funk juggernaut b
 ased out of Western MA\, The Friendship Band began as a class offering of 
 Whole Children ( and has expanded into a premiere live local act\, rocking
  stages such as Flywheel\, Northampton Center for The Arts\, UMASS Ballroo
 m\, The Pines Theater\, The Forbes Library\, and The Iron Horse. The Frien
 dship Band has shared the bill with many wonderful groups including Eavesd
 rop\, Soul Magnets\, The Expandable Brass Band\, and Yo La Tengo. We belie
 ve in the power of music to heal\, and communicate\, and to express our tr
 ue selves.\nhttps://theparlorroom.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket/#/events/
 a0SV500000Cvra9MAB\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/wester
 nma/
