SUMMARY:SAP
LOCATION:The Drake\, 44 N Pleasant St\, Amherst\, MA 01002
DESCRIPTION:with Sludge Mother & Sir Echo\nGeneral Admission (Standing) - D
 oors open at 7PM $15 Advanced\, $20 Day of Show SAP is an independent\, al
 ternative rock trio from Austin\, TX. Infusing the energetic and melodic s
 onics of 90’s grunge with emotionally driven dynamics of contemporary mu
 sic\, Sap creates a perfect soundscape for unpredictable live shows. The b
 and is composed of guitarist/vocalist Evan Fundora\, bassist Hank Barna\, 
 and drummer Jared Cox. Together they have accrued over 6 million streams w
 orldwide\, touring with longstanding bands like The Jins and most recently
  with up and coming acts such as Clarion\, Rehash and Cheerleader Roadkill
 . Sap is set to go on their own US tour in support of their new 2026 album
  ‘Erasure’.\nhttps://www.thedrakeamherst.org/events/sap-w-sludge-mothe
 r-sir-echo\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
