SUMMARY:Briston Maroney - Normal Heights Tour
LOCATION:Iron Horse\, 18 Center St\, Northampton\, MA 01060
DESCRIPTION:with Noah Pope\nArtist Presale: Wednesday\, September 16th @ 10
 am local Local Presale: Thursday\, September 17th @ 10am local Public On-S
 ale: Friday\, September 18th @ 10am local Briston Maroney - Normal Heights
  Tour After growing up in Tennessee and Florida\, singer\, songwriter\, an
 d multi-instrumentalist Briston Maroney has established himself as one of 
 indie rock’s most compelling voices. In2018\, Maroney released his debut
  EP Carnival\, featuring the RIAA Platinum-certified single“Freakin’ O
 ut On The Interstate.” His sophomore album\,Ultrapure(2023)\, produced b
 y GRAMMY® winner Daniel Tashian\, showcased his raw and earnest explorati
 on of human emotion.Following Ultrapure\, Maroney embarked on an extensive
  world tour\, selling out headline shows across North America and Europe w
 hile appearing at festivals including Lollapalooza\, Osheaga\, and All Thi
 ngs Go. In May 2025\, he released his acclaimed third studio album\, Jimmy
 \, before hitting the road on the expansive Long Hair\, Long Life co-headl
 ine tour with Peach Pit\, his biggest run of shows to date. In 2026\, Maro
 ney teamed up with flipturn for a collaborative covers project\, further s
 howcasing his versatility as an artist. With new music on the horizon\, Br
 iston continues to evolve while building a passionate global fanbase and c
 ementing his place as one of indie music’s most exciting artists.\nhttps
 ://theparlorroom.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket/#/events/a0SV500000CqUpbMA
 F\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://theparlorroom.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket/#/events/a0SV50000
 0CqUpbMAF
