SUMMARY:Crystal Bowersox
LOCATION:Iron Horse\, 18 Center St\, Northampton\, MA 01060
DESCRIPTION:with Troy Millette & the Fire Below\nCrystal Bowersox\, a north
 west Ohio native\, has built her world around music. By the age of 10\, sh
 e was performing in local clubs and venues. On the cusp of 18 and with a c
 urious heart\, Crystal moved to Chicago\, IL\, where she spent her days bu
 sking on subway platforms between working odd jobs and attending school.\n
