SUMMARY:Jeffrey Martin
LOCATION:Iron Horse\, 18 Center St\, Northampton\, MA 01060
DESCRIPTION:with Corey Parsons\nJeffrey Martin has been reaching for quiet 
 and stories since he was a kid hiding under the covers with a Discman. He 
 wrote his way through a writing degree\, a teaching degree\, and years of 
 high school English classes filled with unruly brilliance\, all while maki
 ng records and playing shows whenever he could. Eventually\, he left teach
 ing to follow the same dream he encouraged his students to chase. After re
 leasing Thank God We Left the Garden\, he recorded Alive July 25\, 2025\, 
 a no-edits live album captured in Portland with Sam Weber. Jeffrey tours f
 ull time now\, still missing teaching like an old friend he’ll meet agai
 n.\nhttps://theparlorroom.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket/#/events/a0SV5000
